    "group": "Baharroth",
    "summary": "While this model leads a unit, that unit gets these options:\n\n- as your opponent's turn ends, if the unit is outside [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of every enemy unit, you can take it off the battlefield and put it into [Strategic Reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)\n- whenever the unit arrives with [Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike) in [your Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), you can set it up anywhere more than 6\" horizontally from every enemy model, but it then cannot declare a charge for the rest of the turn",
